runCommand: let a plugin pass standard input to a command its manifest grants.
A granted command still takes no spawn options. Its only option is `input`, a
string of at most 1 MiB that the app writes to the command's stdin and closes,
so the k3d plugin can create a cluster from an edited config with
`k3d cluster create --config -`.

